OL,3,AZelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after
OL,4,ATrump calls Russian leader a friend    
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky 
OL,7,Fhas said Vladimir Putin is a "killer"  
OL,8,Fin response to Donald Trump referring  
OL,9,Fto the Russian leader as his "friend"  
OL,10,Fin China this week.                    
OL,12,FSpeaking to CNN, Zelensky said it was  
OL,13,Fup to the US president "how to call    
OL,14,FPutin" but "for us, he is an enemy...  
OL,15,Ffor us, he's a killer".                
OL,17,FBefore Thursday's historic trilateral  
OL,18,Fmeeting with Chinese leader Xi Jinping 
OL,19,Fand Putin, Trump called Putin his      
OL,20,F"friend" and said the two leaders have 
OL,21,Fhad a "great relationship for many     
OL,22,Fyears".                                
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
